# 默认 state/ 子目录内容不进 git
# 各子目录可以单独配 .gitignore 例外保留(如 STATUS.md / last_run.json)
# 子目录被放行后,内部仍需各自的 .gitignore 控制(否则全部进 git)
*
!.gitignore
!STATUS.md
!last_run.json
# 任务子目录放行 + 内容放行(由各子目录自己的 .gitignore 控制具体内容)
!T2/
!T2/**
!T3/
!T3/**
!T1_channels/
!T1_channels/**
!T1_scan_raw/
!T1_scan_raw/**
!T1_candidate/
!T1_candidate/**
!T1_fetched/
!T1_fetched/**
!T1_extracted/
!T1_extracted/**
!T1_quarantine/
!T1_quarantine/**
!T1_ingest_log/
!T1_ingest_log/**
# commentary_ingest:放行台账与状态,不放行正文 staging(原文不进 git)
!commentary_ingest/
!commentary_ingest/processed_ids.jsonl
!commentary_ingest/last_run.json
!commentary_ingest/.gitkeep
